# Storms of Fate (battlefield.storms_of_fate#areas, Riverne Site #B01): Options 2 and 3 ask for areas 2 and 3, and both
# register the fixed area 1 (update 2; the kept Lua quirk of area = 1): kill BAHAMUT, finish, two ticks; the second run
# after the quest var is set again, its 32001 as a repeat (1,6,1,6,29). Each finish runs the quest's 32001
# (StormsOfFate.cs): the first gives main the Whisper of the Wyrmking and Prog 2 -> 3; the second only Prog 2 -> 3 (the
# key item is held).
lists RiverneSiteB01/Unstable_Displacement/onTrigger RiverneSiteB01/onEventUpdate/32000 RiverneSiteB01/onEventFinish/32000 RiverneSiteB01/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RiverneSiteB01 pos=-611.3,1.8,693.2 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.StormsOfFate accepted
charvar Quest[3][86]Prog 2
login
trigger Unstable_Displacement
update 32000 option=2
finish
tick 2000
kill BAHAMUT
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
charvar Quest[3][86]Prog 2
trigger Unstable_Displacement
update 32000 option=3
finish
tick 2000
kill BAHAMUT
finish
tick 11000
tick 10000
